sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Platform Management
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>CategoriesPage
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>CreateCategoryBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>CreateCategoryController
  participant Category as «entity»<br/>Category
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: create a category
  UI->>B: POST /api/management/categories (JWT)
  B->>C: create(CategoryRequest request)
  alt name already used
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 409 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>Category: nameTaken()
  Category->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Category: rows
  Category-->>C: result
  C->>Category: save()
  Category->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Category: rows
  Category-->>C: result
  C-->>B: CategoryResponse
  B-->>UI: 201 Created JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end